<p> Preferred stock dividends			--	    15</p>
<p>Charge related to the exchange of</p>
<p>    preferred stock for common		  --	24,279</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss) applicable</p>
<p>    to common shares			( 2,326)   ( 28,409)</p>
<p> Average common shares outstanding	17,964	10,491</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss) per common share  ( 0.13)     ( 2.71)</p>
